      "description": "One Outcome of a Fixture; becomes a selected plate when Locked.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-locks\"><button class=\"ds-lock\">Arsenal</button><button class=\"ds-lock ds-lock-on\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center\">Draw</button><button class=\"ds-lock\" style=\"text-align:right\">Chelsea</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-locks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 4.5rem 1fr;gap:6px;}.ds-lock{min-height:44px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--rule,#d3dad8);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#15202b);padding:6px 10px;font:600 14px/1.25 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:left;transition:color .15s,background-color .15s,border-color .15s;cursor:pointer;}.ds-lock:hover{border-color:var(--ink-2,#3c4a56);}.ds-lock:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cl,#2f5fa8);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-lock-on,.ds-lock-on:hover{background:var(--sel,#1e2a36);color:var(--on-sel,#fff);border-color:var(--sel,#1e2a36);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--sel,#1e2a36),inset 0 0 0 3.5px var(--on-sel,#fff);}"
    },
